code_snippet:
PATCH /api/v1/listings/{id}
{"price_cents": 4990}
→ 200 OK        // no ETag, no If-Match

// Spec: "Concurrent updates resolve last-write-wins. This is safe because a
//        listing is only ever edited by its owning seller."

// But elsewhere in the same service:
//   - a nightly repricing job PATCHes the same field on 40k listings
//   - support staff can PATCH price_cents from the admin console
// So the resource has three writers, not one.
